  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Silkier Touch 擴充了絲綢之觸附魔的功能。每個功能都可以在設定檔中開啟或關閉。您將能夠拾取物品，例如生成器、龍蛋、蛋糕（尚未被吃掉的）、受感染的石頭等更多物品！<br><br>請見下方設定檔中的完整功能列表。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enableDragonEggDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>使用絲綢之觸鎬子時，將禁用龍蛋的傳送功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableSpawnerDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>啟用怪物生成器在絲綢之觸下掉落。會保留生物資料。<br><br><span><strong>enableTrialSpawnerDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 false<br>降低試煉生成器的「強度」以允許破壞它。將透過鎬子的絲綢之觸進行掉落。更改此設定需要重新啟動遊戲。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>enableFullCakeDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>允許尚未被吃過的蛋糕在絲綢之觸下掉落。同樣適用於插有蠟燭的蛋糕。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>enableBuddedAmethystDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>允許使用絲綢之觸挖掘時掉落簇狀紫水晶。<br><br><span><strong>enableFarmlandDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>允許使用絲綢之觸採收時掉落耕地。<br><br><span><strong>enableTallGrassDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>允許使用絲綢之觸採收時掉落高草。<br><br><span><strong>enableSnowLayerDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>允許使用絲綢之觸採收時掉落雪層。<br><br><span><strong>enableVinesDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true<br>允許使用絲綢之觸採收時掉落藤蔓。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>enableInfestedStoneDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 false<br>允許使用絲綢之觸挖掘時掉落受感染的石頭。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>全部使用絲綢之觸附魔挖掘：<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>怪物生成器：</strong><br><em>試煉生成器預設為停用：</em></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>蛋糕（含或不含蠟燭）與雪層：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>龍蛋不會傳送：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概述與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 存放庫</a>。感謝您！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
